kernel_ogeom

printCAD's programs include the ogeom geometry kernel
(https://github.com/gilbertorconde/ogeom-rs, https://crates.io/crates/ogeom),
which is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1
only (LGPL-2.1-only). Its text is in COPYING.LESSER beside this notice.

The kernel is linked into the programs from the crates.io release named in
the repository's Cargo.lock. printCAD's own source is public, so the
programs can be rebuilt against a modified kernel: point the commented
`ogeom` line in the workspace Cargo.toml's [patch.crates-io] at a checkout
of it and build as the README describes.

printCAD's own code stays under MIT or Apache 2.0, at your option.
